1
00:00:00,145 --> 00:00:07,249
Part 7 mein pharmaceutical companies, principals aur suppliers dekhenge: company jodna,

2
00:00:07,249 --> 00:00:12,801
stockist agreement, supplier profile, credit terms, supplier ledger,

3
00:00:12,801 --> 00:00:15,741
outstanding aur supplier ko payment.

4
00:00:16,698 --> 00:00:20,343
Masters mein Companies and principals kholiye.

5
00:00:20,343 --> 00:00:25,415
Is screen par teen cheezein hain: companies yaani manufacturers,

6
00:00:25,415 --> 00:00:30,884
principals yaani unke saath aapke stockist agreements, aur suppliers,

7
00:00:30,884 --> 00:00:33,182
jinse aap maal kharidte hain.

8
00:00:33,853 --> 00:00:40,468
Saari companies aur supplier names fictional hain, jinke aage Demo likha hai.

9
00:00:40,468 --> 00:00:48,115
Nayi company jodte hain: Add company kholiye, naam Kavach Demo Pharma, short name KAVACH,

10
00:00:48,115 --> 00:00:49,833
aur contact details.

11
00:00:50,485 --> 00:00:58,030
Principal ka matlab hai company ke saath aapka agreement: kis supplier ya C and F se maal

12
00:00:58,030 --> 00:01:03,541
aata hai, aapka margin, divisions, aur expiry return ki shartein,

13
00:01:03,541 --> 00:01:11,001
jaise expiry se 90 din pehle se 180 din baad tak claim, aur kitne percent credit milega.

14
00:01:11,660 --> 00:01:14,573
Yeh expiry terms bahut zaroori hain.

15
00:01:14,573 --> 00:01:20,236
Medoro inhi se tay karta hai ki koi batch claim ke laayak hai ya nahi,

16
00:01:20,236 --> 00:01:23,229
aur kitna credit milne ki ummeed hai.

17
00:01:23,229 --> 00:01:27,760
Isliye har company ke principal mein sahi terms bhariye.

18
00:01:28,415 --> 00:01:33,504
Neeche suppliers ki list hai: GSTIN, credit days, lead time,

19
00:01:33,504 --> 00:01:38,933
expiry returns lete hain ya nahi, aur ab ek naya column, We owe,

20
00:01:38,933 --> 00:01:42,835
yaani hum is supplier ko kitna dene wale hain.

21
00:01:43,489 --> 00:01:50,758
Naya supplier jodne ke liye Add supplier kholiye: naam, GSTIN, phone, credit days,

22
00:01:50,758 --> 00:01:54,747
lead time, return window aur opening balance.

23
00:01:54,747 --> 00:02:00,597
Doosre state ka GSTIN ho toh purchase par IGST apne-aap lagta hai.

24
00:02:01,266 --> 00:02:07,199
Ab kisi supplier par click kariye, jaise Aarogya Demo C and F Agency.

25
00:02:07,199 --> 00:02:13,304
Yeh supplier ka ledger page hai: hum kitna dene wale hain, credit days,

26
00:02:13,304 --> 00:02:16,142
aakhri kharid aur aakhri payment.

27
00:02:16,795 --> 00:02:22,162
Ledger statement mein har GRN credit mein aata hai, aur har payment,

28
00:02:22,162 --> 00:02:25,397
debit note ya claim ka credit debit mein.

29
00:02:25,397 --> 00:02:29,659
Running balance batata hai ki kis din kitna baaki tha.

30
00:02:29,659 --> 00:02:33,447
Date range chun kar statement nikaal sakte hain.

31
00:02:34,108 --> 00:02:39,404
Supplier ko payment dene ke liye Pay supplier mein amount, mode,

32
00:02:39,404 --> 00:02:42,135
aur UTR ya cheque number bhariye.

33
00:02:42,135 --> 00:02:45,114
Hum 50,000 rupaye NEFT se dete hain.

34
00:02:45,114 --> 00:02:52,728
Record payment dabaate hi payment voucher banta hai aur sabse purane bill pehle chukte hain.

35
00:02:53,379 --> 00:02:57,878
Payment post ho gaya, aur We owe ka aankda kam ho gaya.

36
00:02:57,878 --> 00:03:02,867
Neeche statement mein naya payment voucher bhi dikh raha hai.

37
00:03:02,867 --> 00:03:07,775
Recent GRNs mein is supplier se aaye saare maal ki list hai.

38
00:03:08,422 --> 00:03:14,242
Yeh supplier ledger aur payment screen is project ki QA ke dauraan banaya gaya,

39
00:03:14,242 --> 00:03:20,872
kyunki pehle Distribution mein supplier ka outstanding sirf trial balance mein ek total ki

40
00:03:20,872 --> 00:03:22,124
tarah dikhta tha.

41
00:03:22,124 --> 00:03:25,218
Ab har supplier ka hisaab alag dikhta hai.

42
00:03:26,873 --> 00:03:33,284
Part 8 mein poora purchase process: purchase order banana, supplier ko bhejna,

43
00:03:33,284 --> 00:03:38,051
maal aane par batch aur expiry ke saath GRN, totals check,

44
00:03:38,051 --> 00:03:41,749
aur stock aur supplier outstanding ka update.

45
00:03:42,754 --> 00:03:45,205
Purchase and GRN kholiye.

46
00:03:45,205 --> 00:03:52,559
Upar flow likha hai: purchase planning, PO, supplier invoice, GRN, batches,

47
00:03:52,559 --> 00:03:55,109
stock aur supplier ledger.

48
00:03:55,109 --> 00:04:00,894
Teen tabs hain: Receive goods, Purchase orders, aur New PO.

49
00:04:01,634 --> 00:04:08,955
Purchase orders list mein har PO ka number, supplier, date, value aur status hai: draft,

50
00:04:08,955 --> 00:04:12,283
ordered, partially received ya received.

51
00:04:12,283 --> 00:04:18,190
Ek PO pehle se ordered hai, aur ek draft hai jise abhi bheja nahi gaya.

52
00:04:22,298 --> 00:04:24,298
Naya PO banate hain.

53
00:04:24,298 --> 00:04:33,698
New PO tab mein supplier chuniye: Prana vitamins ke liye Eastern Demo Super Stockist, Kolkata.

54
00:04:33,698 --> 00:04:36,698
Product chuniye: Zincosure 20.

55
00:04:36,698 --> 00:04:43,198
Quantity 200 packs, aur free quantity 20, yaani 10 plus 1 scheme.

56
00:04:43,892 --> 00:04:50,644
Rate apne-aap PTS se aata hai, jise supplier ke rate se badal sakte hain.

57
00:04:50,644 --> 00:04:52,679
MRP bhi bhara hua hai.

58
00:04:52,679 --> 00:04:56,101
Trade discount 2 percent daalte hain.

59
00:04:56,101 --> 00:05:00,448
Neeche approx value GST ke saath dikh rahi hai.

60
00:05:03,131 --> 00:05:07,832
Ek aur line jodte hain: Ferrovit XT, 150 packs.

61
00:05:07,832 --> 00:05:09,733
Phir Save draft PO.

62
00:05:09,733 --> 00:05:17,335
PO pehle draft mein banta hai, taaki bhejne se pehle koi aur check kar sake.

63
00:05:17,990 --> 00:05:22,655
Purchase orders tab mein naya PO draft status mein hai.

64
00:05:22,655 --> 00:05:25,539
Place dabaiye, aur confirm kariye.

65
00:05:25,539 --> 00:05:31,138
Ab status ordered ho gaya, yaani supplier ko order bhej diya gaya.

66
00:05:36,665 --> 00:05:38,199
Ab maal aa gaya.

67
00:05:38,199 --> 00:05:40,691
Receive goods tab kholiye.

68
00:05:40,691 --> 00:05:47,880
Against PO mein Aarogya ka winter season wala PO, number dekh kar, chuniye.

69
00:05:47,880 --> 00:05:55,645
Supplier aur PO ki lines apne-aap bhar jaati hain: Febrinil 650 aur Amoxirise CV.

70
00:05:56,330 --> 00:06:00,804
Supplier ke bill ka number aur date daaliye.

71
00:06:00,804 --> 00:06:05,786
Har line par batch number aur expiry zaroori hai.

72
00:06:05,786 --> 00:06:10,666
Febrinil ka batch FEB2611A, expiry October 2028.

73
00:06:10,666 --> 00:06:16,462
Scheme ke 120 packs free mein aaye, woh Free column mein.

74
00:06:17,136 --> 00:06:22,887
Amoxirise CV ka batch AMC2611B aur expiry March 2028.

75
00:06:22,887 --> 00:06:27,661
Quantity check kariye: jo aaya wahi likhiye.

76
00:06:27,661 --> 00:06:34,172
Agar kam aaya toh kam likhiye, PO partially received rahega.

77
00:06:34,846 --> 00:06:38,889
Ab supplier invoice par chhapa hua total daaliye.

78
00:06:38,889 --> 00:06:42,685
Maan lijiye galti se gol rakam 30,000 likh di.

79
00:06:42,685 --> 00:06:47,966
Post GRN dabate hi Medoro rok deta hai: totals match nahi karte,

80
00:06:47,966 --> 00:06:51,762
lines itne ki hain aur invoice itna kehta hai.

81
00:06:52,412 --> 00:06:59,225
Yeh check bahut kaam ka hai: typing ki galti, chhoota hua item, ya galat rate,

82
00:06:59,225 --> 00:07:01,496
sab yahin pakda jaata hai.

83
00:07:01,496 --> 00:07:05,776
Sahi total daal kar dobara Post GRN dabaate hain.

84
00:07:06,446 --> 00:07:07,904
GRN post ho gaya.

85
00:07:07,904 --> 00:07:11,335
Recent GRNs mein naya GRN dikh raha hai.

86
00:07:11,335 --> 00:07:17,168
Iske saath teen cheezein ek saath hui: naye batches stock mein aaye,

87
00:07:17,168 --> 00:07:24,202
free goods ki wajah se landed cost kam hui, aur supplier ka outstanding badh gaya.

88
00:07:24,873 --> 00:07:31,768
Stock screen par Febrinil ka naya batch FEB2611A dikh raha hai,

89
00:07:31,768 --> 00:07:36,365
720 packs ke saath: 600 kharide, 120 free.

90
00:07:37,162 --> 00:07:43,486
Aur supplier ke ledger mein yeh GRN credit mein aa gaya, toh We owe badh gaya.

91
00:07:43,486 --> 00:07:45,918
PO ka status received ho gaya.

92
00:07:46,575 --> 00:07:52,958
Yaad rakhiye: PO matlab aapne kya maanga, GRN matlab asal mein kya aaya.

93
00:07:52,958 --> 00:08:00,227
Hamesha GRN supplier ke bill se milakar, batch aur expiry dekh kar hi post kariye.
